3. Prohibited uses

  No license is granted, even for Noncommercial Use, to use, modify, or
  distribute the Software or any Derivative Work to:
    (a) create, support, or distribute game cheats or unfair gameplay
        modifications, including wallhacks, chams, ESP or world-to-screen
        overlays, aimbots, triggerbots, occlusion or smoke/foliage removal,
        or automated gameplay bots;
    (b) scan, read, or write process memory to alter gameplay state, speed,
        timers, cooldowns, or game logic beyond the display frame-rate cap
        holding in lepas;
    (c) bypass, hide from, disable, or spoof anti-cheat, anti-tamper, or
        client-integrity checks.
